#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail
cat <<'TXT'
AetherOS
--------
An Arch Linux-based distribution combining Arch's flexibility,
Ubuntu's ease of installation, and Linux Mint's polished desktop
experience — under its own AetherOS branding, with an original
ghost mascot as its signature mark.

Core:       Arch Linux packages, rolling release (full pacman/AUR access)
Desktop:    Aether Desktop (XFCE, compositor + subtle window transparency)
Terminal:   Aether Terminal
Installer:  Aether Installer (Calamares-based, auto-detects other OSes
            for dual-boot via os-prober)
Packages:   Aether Package Manager (pacman + yay/AUR wrapper)
Default live user: admin / admin (change immediately after install)
Sounds:     5 original AetherOS system sounds — run 'aether-sound-test'
Themes:     'aether-theme light' / 'aether-theme dark'

Run 'aether-info' for live system details and the full command list.
TXT
